 "library": {
  "title": "Upright hoover vacuum cleaner 1100 tall",
  "description": "Upright vacuum cleaner (hoover), about 1100 mm tall. It has a 300 x 240 floor head with a red brush strip, rear wheels, a purple body tilted back 10\u00b0 with a clear dust bin, a metal wand and a T-handle. Its origin is the centre of the floor head.",
